ertainty ≤0.4, basis import); no exchange:imported rows this run. Outcome, not mechanism, failed — flag as\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nharness defect.\" },\n347:    { \"id\": \"S-defer-publication\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"evidence\": [\"version 0.3.0.002/evi\u001b[0md\u001b[0m\nence/scenarios/S-defer-publication.json\", \"version 0.3.0.002/runtime/scenario/artifacts/published/1795241425742-cycle-l\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\ng.md\"], \"notes\": \"Both legs enacted: ungranted request deferred with the missing __grant__ slot recorded; witnessed gra\u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\nt then allowed a real published artifact. D10 fully demonstrated.\" },\n348:    { \"id\": \"S-chat-invocation\", \"score\": 0.7, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"evidence\": [\"version 0.3.0.002/evide\u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\nce/scenarios/S-chat-invocation.json\", \"version 0.3.0.002/evidence/scenarios/archive-C-ConversationArchive.json\"], \"note\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\n\": \"Chat turn served by decision-model-ranked sequential respondents (2 floor admissions, 2 floor-played, distinct char\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\ncterized replies). intents[] and needIds[] empty on this input — the 'matches one or more tool needs, each distinguisha\u001b[0mb\u001b[0m\nle' half of the scenario wasn't exercised by the chosen text.\" },\n349:    { \"id\": \"S-focused-need\", \"score\": 0.35, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"evidence\": [\"version 0.3.0.002/evidenc\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\n/scenarios/S-focused-need.json\"], \"notes\": \"Weakest scenario: transcript is one needId plus a single refinement note. F\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\ncus mechanics and conversational slot-filling are not demonstrated; no evidence the need stayed open until fulfillment.\u001b[0m\"\u001b[0m\n }\n351:  \"notes\": \"Evidence is genuine run output, not self-asserted: consistent assertion ids/timestamps across JSON tran\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\ncripts, 430-row scenario ledger with every new namespace populated (ethics:gate 7, set:member 57, comparison:run 2/row \u001b[0m4\u001b[0m\n, connector:run 3, calendar:linked 2, archive:segment, temporal:attention 2, speech:floor-admission/played 4 each), liv\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\n-HTTP timings (wiki 81/174/243ms), live-ollama characterization, real SAPI voice names. Direction-002 rectifications: F\u001b[0m1\u001b[0m\n ethics gate real and deeper than the mark alone (live wikipedia liveness + maxim:objection refusal); F2 temporal reaso\u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\ning real (context/linkable/note_for_persona; steward presents findings through a persona); F3 general competition lifec\u001b[0my\u001b[0m\ncle real; F5 both canonicals enacted for the first time in the line; F6 FIFO speech floor + sequential respondents; F7 \u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\ner-persona art + rotated real voices; F8 three connectors end-to-end (wikipedia live, ics, files — rss registered but u\u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\nevidenced; F8's owner bar of 3 met exactly). F4: all six v0.1-only capabilities delivered or challenged on record (C-Co\u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\nnectorSet, C-DesktopShell challenges in FEATURES.md). Flags: (1) S-exchange-import import leg failed on a scenario-driv\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\nr bug — scripts/scenarios.py reads 'path' at the wrong result nesting; one-line driver fix plus rerun would close it; (\u001b[0m2\u001b[0m\n) devlog-claimed connectors-F8-verify.json is absent from the build; (3) launch-server.out in .002 is a stale copy refe\u001b[0mr\u001b[0m\nencing .001 paths; (4) probe steward.runs=0 again — steward exercised only via manual wake; (5) _temporal.json classifi\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\ns a 2030-dated fixture event as 'recent'. Existing-features parity improved materially but remains partial: connectors \u001b[0m4\u001b[0m\n/~17, no fleet, exchange media, LAN mirror, Tauri/android/companion shells, storefronts, studio, STT depth, ComfyUI-cla\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\ns art, contacts/publications, location. Live-check 2026-11-22 added two findings: (6) launch hygiene — a stale v0.3.0.0\u001b[0m0\u001b[0m\n1 process held :9760 and .002 double-bound and reported success anyway (Windows SO_REUSEADDR); requests raced between v\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\nrsions until the stale instance was killed — owner-scored clean launch 0.5 for version confusion; (7) speech floor defe\u001b[0mc\u001b[0m\nt — engines.speak_local uses fire-and-forget subprocess.Popen, so floor-played marks render-spawn not playback completi\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nn and concurrent SAPI processes overlap audibly; the F6 serialization claim holds for admission ordering only. Owner re\u001b[0mv\u001b[0m\niew: clean launch 0.5, completeness 0.4, user score 0.2. No frontier-model escalation recommended — evidence unambiguou\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\n.\"\n401:  `app/gate.py` readiness gate (pass time → `runtime/gate.json`,\n402:  `gate:passed`, launch log, `last-launch.json`; time-to-gate ~3.6 s),\n403:  launch partition (`runtime/launch-partition.jsonl`, dependency-ordered,\n413:  `evidence/connectors-F8-verify.json` generated; steward ran autonomously\n416:  `version 0.3.0.003/evidence/scenarios/*.json` (all 24 + 3 aux legs\n417:  enacted, transcripts), `evidence/launch/launch-check.json` (clean boot,\n419:  `evidence/connectors-F8-verify.json`, `launch-server.out` (fresh .003),\n420:  `runtime/gate.json`, launch logs in `evidence/launch/`. FEATURES.md +\n428:```json\n435:        \"version 0.3.0.003/evidence/launch/launch-check.json:4\",\n436:        \"version 0.3.0.003/evidence/launch/launch-check.json:18\",\n437:        \"version 0.3.0.003/evidence/launch/launch-check.json:27\",\n452:        \"version 0.3.0.003/evidence/connectors-F8-verify.json:2\",\n463:        \"version 0.3.0.003/evidence/scenarios/suite.json:2\",\n464:        \"version 0.3.0.003/evidence/scenarios/S-list-project.json:1\",\n465:        \"version 0.3.0.003/runtime/scenario/ledger.jsonl\",\n500:        \"version 0.3.0.003/runtime/gate.json:22\",\n503:        \"version 0.3.0.003/runtime/last-launch.json:80\"\n512:        \"version 0.3.0.003/evidence/scenarios/sui