{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"exec:0#7620f2cc95634245a320cfbbfb57b3bf","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"### Cycle 4 — 2026-11-23\n\n- **Direction:** `direction-004.md` — SIGNED by owner 2026-11-23; fresh\n  realization of `prompt.md`, built better than `.003`. Build guidance per\n  `shortcomings-004.md`: G-A live owner-facing controls, G-B voice as\n  register constraint on truthful output (owner-approved source-faithfulness\n  bar), G-C dyadic confidence (skippable this run; .5 default for new\n  personas if built), G-D browsable Library, G-E operable roster, G-F clean\n  evidence. Suite amendments adopted: tightened S-color-schemes, extended\n  S-personality-roster, new S-library-browse, new S-faithful-voice → 26\n  scenarios. **Fleet discovery remains deferred** (owner ruling\n  2026-11-23) alongside fleet install.\n- **Baseline:** fresh from prompt (owner ruling 2026-11-23) — produces\n  `version 0.3.0.004/`; `.003` kept intact as comparison point\n- **Prompt:** `prompt.md` (snapshot of 2026-11-18, unchanged this cycle)\n- **Criteria:** clean launch (incl. launch hygiene), existing features,\n  completeness (fleet install, fleet discovery, exchange media count\n  against it), fleet install (expected 0), exchange media (expected 0),\n  user score, time-to-gate (standing), scenario suite\n  `.devin/scenarios.md` (26 scenarios; canonicals must enact),\n  `time to implement` tracked not scored\n- **Time to implement:** session start 2026-11-23 ~03:48; session end\n  2026-11-23 ~04:31\n- **Result:** Vantage — fresh realization in `version 0.3.0.004/`\n  (Python stdlib only; `.003` untouched). Assertion ledger (append-only\n  JSONL, typed values, claimants, basis, supersession, contextual\n  confidence, snapshots, launch partition, transient boundary,\n  compaction); needs floor + templates + candidate ranking + witnessed\n  grants; 40-tool registry with DSL steps and user-authored tools; two\n  adequate competing retrievals on `set.members` (wiki table vs\n  category); persona store with ethics gate + ◆ IMITATION mark, six\n  seeded personas + mint/onboard, unique bound procedural portraits,\n  SAPI voice config, operable roster (select + reorder as dyadic\n  rows); register-constrained compose with grounding check — ungrounded\n  drafts flagged + withheld, no-source factual replies flagged; live\n  Ollama `llama3.2`, SAPI speech floor with measured `playbackMs`;\n  steward + temporal attention; wikipedia/ics/files/rss/inbox-eml\n  connectors; exchange export/import held at 0.4 (self-import dedupes);\n  readiness gate (PASS ~2.3s, recorded); two-part boot, owned-port\n  refusal (exit 3), close-terminate watchdog; UI with live theme\n  selector, holdings Library, personality editor, inbox, status bar.\n  Evidence: `version 0.3.0.004/FEATURES.md`, `LAUNCH.md`,\n  `evidence/launch/launch-check.json` (all three hygiene checks pass),\n  `evidence/launch/launch-*.log`, `runtime/*/gate.json` +\n  `last-launch.json` (time-to-gate ~2.3s), `evidence/scenarios/S-*.json`\n  + `suite.json` — **26/26 scenario files pass, inline checks embedded**\n  (canonicals S-list-project: 57 real PA cities via competing\n  retrievals; S-personality-create: mint→onboard→extend). Declared\n  absences (counted, not faked): fleet install, fleet discovery,\n  exchange media, OAuth connectors, server-side STT.\n\u001b[0m[... 22 lines omitted ...]\n  \"judge_model\": \"SWE-2 High\",\n  \"user_commentary\": [\n    { \"criterion\": \"user score\", \"opinion\": 0.45, \"reasoning\": \"Owner 2026-11-23: 'this is an improvement.'\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"completeness\", \"opinion\": 0.48, \"reasoning\": \"Owner estimate 2026-11-23 — 0.48 vs JEV 0.85. Third c\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nnsecutive cycle of large JEV/owner divergence on this criterion (0.85→0.5 in Cycle 3): mechanism-completeness again sco\u001b[0mr\u001b[0m\ned above enacted/user-perceived completeness — feed into judge calibration and criterion definition at review.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"persona art\", \"opinion\": null, \"reasoning\": \"Personality profiles are a step in the right direction\u001b[0m,\u001b[0m\n but the expectation is AI/LLM-built art, not procedurally drawn sprites — which they currently look like.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"header feature list\", \"opinion\": null, \"reasoning\": \"The header has a list that looks like features\u001b[0m,\u001b[0m\n but they are really deferred features — confusing.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"workshop\", \"opinion\": null, \"reasoning\": \"Workshop hard to interpret because of lack of familiarity\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nwith some defined functions — an explanation of each would be helpful.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"roster reorder/confidence\", \"opinion\": null, \"reasoning\": \"Avatar reordering is supposed to affect \u001b[0mc\u001b[0m\nonfidence scores via the dyadic model — the scores do not seem to update. (G-C was skippable this run; the build delive\u001b[0mr\u001b[0m\ned dyadic roster:rank rows anyway, but the owner's live check shows no visible score change on reorder.)\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"diagnostic beeps\", \"opinion\": null, \"reasoning\": \"Diagnostic beeps are helpful, but their proposed \u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nurpose was communicating to other instances — user-directed alerts should be a jingle or welcome tone.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"personality editing\", \"opinion\": null, \"reasoning\": \"Unclear how to edit existing personalities — t\u001b[0mh\u001b[0m\ne editor exists (JEV: S-personality-editor 0.85 enactment) but is not discoverable to the owner.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"email commentary\", \"opinion\": null, \"reasoning\": \"Owner 2026-11-23: displaying sample emails does n\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nt demonstrate that user email can be read — the S-email-commentary enactment ran on fixture .eml files, not a configure\u001b[0md\u001b[0m\n real account source.\" }\n  ],\n  \"scenarios\": [\n    { \"id\": \"S-assertion-input\", \"score\": 0.8, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Typed input recorded as a sourc\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\n-aware assertion row. Thin but real.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-template-need\", \"score\": 0.8, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Need opened before fill, template\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\ngate passed, durable result + topic applied.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-candidate-ranking\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Three candidates inspectable\u001b[0m,\u001b[0m\n ranked by effective confidence; low-confidence evidence retained un-superseded.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-list-project\", \"score\": 0.95, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Canonical, genuinely enacted: 57 \u001b[0mr\u001b[0m\neal PA incorporated municipalities via two competing retrievals with agreement accounting (55 shared; Philadelphia/Harr\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nsburg single-source), 200 classified non-matches retained. Strongest canonical enactment on this line.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-personality-create\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Canonical enacted: mint→onbo\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\nrd→extend — persistent identity, bound procedural portrait, SAPI voice, generated characterization, coherent distinct r\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nster entry.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-background-present\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"4 autonomous steward runs b\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\nfore manual wake; temporal attention presented through a persona; far-future correctly classified.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-competing-tools\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"J3 closed: two adequate compet\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nng tools enacted on the same need; cross-validated in S-list-project.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-restart-recovery\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Real process stop/restart; sta\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\ne survives; cleanup compaction preserved supersession/provenance rows.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-exchange-import\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Real export+import; contents h\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\nld at 0.4 < 0.5 threshold by construction; self-import dedupes.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-defer-publication\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Ungranted request deferred wi\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\nh recorded reason; granted executes to local-outbox delivered:false — honest channel.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-chat-invocation\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Tool need + response need open\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\nd distinguishably; 3 persona replies via snapshot inference + ranked commits.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-focused-need\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Need deferred on missing slot, fo\u001b[0mc\u001b[0m\nused, filled conversationally, fulfilled; candidate recorded.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-personality-roster\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Extended bar met: selection \u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\nhrough the control path, reorder persists with dyadic roster:rank assertions, 8/8 distinct (J1 closed), every persona r\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\nachable. BUT see owner commentary — reorder does not visibly update confidence scores.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-portrait-bind\", \"score\": 0.8, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"All 8 personas carry unique bound\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nprocedural SVG portraits; files verified. Procedural SVG, not AI-rendered — same ceiling as .003; owner confirms this i\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\n the core complaint (expects LLM-built art).\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-color-schemes\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Tightened bar met: selector's con\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\nrol path driven end-to-end, restyle observed; fresh launch defaults light; 4 colorways.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-status-bar\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Live LLM mode and sources shown incl\u001b[0m.\u001b[0m\n honestly-declared-absent gmail-oauth. Owner flag: the header list reads as features but is deferred features — confusi\u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\ng labeling.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-email-commentary\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"3 fixture .eml listed, select\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\non enters context, real persona commentary offered.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-conversation-reset\", \"score\": 0.8, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Reset clears topic/context; \u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nrior segment sealed with surviving transcript.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-context-display\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Active context surfaced with b\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\ndge control.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-personality-editor\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Editor round-trip works via\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nassertions — but owner live check: unclear how to edit existing personalities; discoverability gap between mechanism an\u001b[0md\u001b[0m\n surface.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-windows-launch\", \"score\": 0.75, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"launch.cmd boots like an instal\u001b[0ml\u001b[0m\ned program; script launcher, not packaged install — same ceiling as prior cycles.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-close-terminate\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Real termination after last SS\u001b[0mE\u001b[0m\n window closes; checks carried inline (J4 closed).\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-speech-serialization\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"J2 closed: floor-played ro\u001b[0mw\u001b[0m\ns carry real measured playbackMs; serialized, no overlap.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-distinct-preloadeds\", \"score\": 0.85, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"Same prompt → Jaccard 0.07\u001b[0m–\u001b[0m\n0.09, clearly different live responses. Blemish: one reply leaks internal 'FACTS' scaffolding vocabulary.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-library-browse\", \"score\": 0.9, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"New scenario (R4/G-D): holdings \u001b[0mb\u001b[0m\nrowser with inspectable detail surface — personas/tools/artifacts/packages — not a log tail.\" },\n    { \"id\": \"S-faithful-voice\", \"score\": 0.7, \"evidence_class\": \"enactment\", \"notes\": \"New scenario (R2/G-B): FIDELITY \u001b[0mR\u001b[0m\nULE + grounding check + withhold-in-register + fidelity-flag rows real; two replies honestly withheld, one accurate ans\u001b[0mw\u001b[0m\ner, no invention. Weaknesses: 'retrieved+used' check passes on zero hits; live reply carried fidelity:null — ungrounded\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nand unflagged despite being source-unsupported. Bar met in spirit; check suite lenient.\" }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"Strong cycle — amended 26-scenario suite fully enacted with genuine run artifacts (1584-row scenario ledger\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\ncorroborates; artifacts/exports/outbox on disk; live-ollama replies). Instance serving on :9770 at JEV time, honesty ba\u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\nner declares all absences incl. the browser-surface/desktop-shell reckoning — no silent convention departures. All Cycl\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\n-3 J-flags closed (J1–J4). R1/R4/R5 mechanisms delivered; R2 fidelity mechanism real but check suite lenient (zero-hit \u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nass, fidelity:null on live reply); R3 skippable yet delivered (dyadic rel:held-confidence at 0.5 — though owner reports\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nreorder does not visibly update scores). Canonicals enacted — defensible 57-city S-list-project. Declared absences hone\u001b[0ms\u001b[0m\ntly recorded: fleet install, fleet discovery, exchange media (JSON import only), OAuth connectors, server-side STT, nat\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nve shell, studio/satellites/companion. No frontier-model escalation recommended.\"\n}\n```\n\n## Owner review — Cycle 4 (2026-11-23, in progress)\n\nOwner-scored user score **0.45** — \"this is an improvement\"; completeness\n**0.48** (vs JEV 0.85 — third cycle of large JEV/owner divergence on this"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","cognition.ai/terminalPreview":true}}}}
