{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm defining scenario IDs as the union of IDs from `.devin/scenarios.md` and any verdict scenarios. For the current state, I'm establishing the `prompt_revision` by checking if the first line of `prompt.md` matches a specific revision or snapshot format. If `prompt.md` references a local corpus file, I'll use its last write time as `corpus_prompt_mtime`."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:29:16.531897100+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm associating corpus paths by parsing `prompt.md` for local paths; if found, that directory becomes the corpus root. Otherwise, if `prompt.md` says \"embedded\" or no path exists, the project itself is the corpus, and convention IDs are derived from project-side `conventions*.md` files, marked by source. This approach avoids double-counting proposals and clearly labels convention sources. For `harness-ui`, no corpus path is derivable, and no `conventions*.md` files exist, so its convention ID set will be empty, correctly rendered as a gap."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:29:17.654287500+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm checking the `prompt.md` for the project's revision information. If it's embedded, I'll parse the local file path to find the corpus directory and `CONVENTIONS.md`. If the prompt file itself declares a revision or date, I'll use that; otherwise, I'll fall back to the file's last-write time. The live prompt revision for the current state view depends on `state.json`, but if it's absent, I'll use the corpus prompt's revision or mtime."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:29:20.690224200+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"Environment is good: PS 5.1, Python 3.12, Node 24, Edge+Chrome for headless render-checks. One more check — the corpus prompt file's revision marker for the current-state view."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:29:20.690327600+00:00"}}}}
