{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've found a bug where `Get-ConventionIdsFromFile` is called too early, hardcoding the default corpus path into convention IDs for every project. This incorrectly attributes conventions to projects like `harness-ui`. I need to remove that line so convention IDs are correctly merged later, only when a project-specific conventions file is found. The fallback search for `CONVENTIONS.md` also needs refinement to avoid misattributing conventions."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:30:59.410381400+00:00"}}}}
