{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm refining how the corpus directory is derived. It should now search the prompt's directory and two ancestors for `CONVENTIONS.md`, falling back to the `CorpusRoot` parameter only if necessary, and marking that source. I also found a bug where `[version]::Parse` fails on empty strings when sorting builds; I'll fix this by safely parsing versions and sorting by the parsed version or modification time. Finally, I'll ensure the latest build is correctly identified from the sorted list and that builds are emitted in sorted order."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:31:01.754265100+00:00"}}}}
