{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I'm designing harness.js now, the largest part. The core logic involves polling `data.js` every 30 seconds, but only when the page is visible. I'll use `setInterval` combined with `document.hidden` to manage this. A visibility change to 'visible' should trigger an immediate poll. The rendering will rebuild the `#app` element, and a separate interval will update the \"age\" indicators. The fleet and project views will have distinct table structures and content."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:32:00.086415700+00:00"}}}}
