{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nFor the build-detail launch pointer, I'll use `encodeURI` to handle spaces in the URL, as browsers encode them automatically. The depth picker for the chart's x-axis will use a `<select>` element with options for \"all,\" 5, 10, and 3 runs, defaulting to the smaller of 10 or the total number of runs. I'll also add honest absence markers using `—` for cells and `.gap` blocks with explanations, and apply specific `data-*` attributes to body elements for rendering checks. When refocusing, the page will reload `data.js` only if a newer stamp is detected, ensuring re-renders only happen when necessary, as per the spec."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:32:16.432664+00:00"}}}}
