{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I'm tracing the error: it seems to happen after emitting harness-ui but before the \"project: project\" log. The fleet-row build for harness-ui occurs right after \"emitted ... display,\" and it uses GP, which calls `$obj.Contains($name)`. The `$data.status_files.Count` is empty, which is fine. The failure isn't in `ConvertTo-Json` because \"emitted\" is logged after `Write-TextFile`. The order is: emitted logged, then `$fleetRows.Add`, which references `$data.state` and uses GP."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:34:31.524147600+00:00"}}}}
