{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"ubiquitous-eyebrow","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"The scan itself is clean, but `harness-ui`'s liveness calculation is circular: the scan log's modification time is used, but the log is written during the scan. This makes the project appear maximally live, which is misleading. Excluding the log file from liveness calculations is a simple, correct fix, though computing liveness before writing the log would be even better. The project's overall liveness age of 13s, from `runtime/ledger.jsonl`, is acceptable as it's a legitimate project file."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:54:56.036086200+00:00"}}}}
